<!-- RemoteFlow 程序图标（玻璃双屏）。1024 设计网格，圆角底座 824 居中（四周留白符合 macOS 图标规范）。
     由 scripts/render-appicon.ps1 渲染为各尺寸 PNG，再由 scripts/build-appicon.py 打包；16 / 24 / 32 px 改用 AppIcon-small.xaml。 -->
<!-- 圆角方块底座：蓝 → 靛立体渐变 + 顶部受光 + 底部压暗 + 内描边 -->
<Grid Width="1024" Height="1024" xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation">
  <Border Width="824" Height="824" CornerRadius="186" Margin="0,26,0,0">
    <Border.Background><SolidColorBrush Color="#1A2370" /></Border.Background>
    <Border.Effect><BlurEffect Radius="46" /></Border.Effect>
    <Border.Opacity>0.55</Border.Opacity>
  </Border>
  <Border Width="824" Height="824" CornerRadius="186">
    <Border.Background>
      <LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0.15,0" EndPoint="0.85,1">
        <GradientStop Color="#6F98FF" Offset="0" />
        <GradientStop Color="#3E62F0" Offset="0.45" />
        <GradientStop Color="#2B36B8" Offset="1" />
      </LinearGradientBrush>
    </Border.Background>
    <Grid>
      <Grid.Clip><RectangleGeometry Rect="0,0,824,824" RadiusX="186" RadiusY="186" /></Grid.Clip>
      <Ellipse Width="900" Height="700" Margin="-360,-420,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Top">
        <Ellipse.Fill><RadialGradientBrush><GradientStop Color="#66FFFFFF" Offset="0" /><GradientStop Color="#00FFFFFF" Offset="1" /></RadialGradientBrush></Ellipse.Fill>
      </Ellipse>
      <Rectangle VerticalAlignment="Bottom" Height="360">
        <Rectangle.Fill><LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="0,1"><GradientStop Color="#00101A60" Offset="0" /><GradientStop Color="#55101A60" Offset="1" /></LinearGradientBrush></Rectangle.Fill>
      </Rectangle>
      <Canvas Width="824" Height="824">
        <!-- 后屏：半透明玻璃 -->
        <Border Canvas.Left="150" Canvas.Top="150" Width="420" Height="300" CornerRadius="54" BorderThickness="4" BorderBrush="#66FFFFFF">
          <Border.Background><LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="1,1"><GradientStop Color="#55FFFFFF" Offset="0" /><GradientStop Color="#1AFFFFFF" Offset="1" /></LinearGradientBrush></Border.Background>
        </Border>
        <!-- 前屏机身投影 -->
        <Border Canvas.Left="262" Canvas.Top="300" Width="430" Height="312" CornerRadius="56" Background="#0B1450" Opacity="0.55">
          <Border.Effect><BlurEffect Radius="40" /></Border.Effect>
        </Border>
        <!-- 前屏：白色机身 -->
        <Border Canvas.Left="252" Canvas.Top="270" Width="430" Height="312" CornerRadius="56">
          <Border.Background><LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="0,1"><GradientStop Color="#FFFFFFFF" Offset="0" /><GradientStop Color="#FFDCE6FF" Offset="1" /></LinearGradientBrush></Border.Background>
        </Border>
        <!-- 屏幕 -->
        <Border Canvas.Left="282" Canvas.Top="300" Width="370" Height="252" CornerRadius="34" ClipToBounds="True">
          <Border.Background><LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="1,1"><GradientStop Color="#FF1E2C8E" Offset="0" /><GradientStop Color="#FF2B49D8" Offset="1" /></LinearGradientBrush></Border.Background>
          <Canvas>
            <Path Data="M0,0 L230,0 L110,252 L0,252 Z" Fill="#14FFFFFF" />
          </Canvas>
        </Border>
        <!-- 流光：带辉光的曲线连接两个端点 -->
        <Path Data="M335,505 C 420,505 420,360 520,360 S 600,360 600,360" StrokeThickness="44" StrokeStartLineCap="Round" StrokeEndLineCap="Round" Opacity="0.55">
          <Path.Stroke><SolidColorBrush Color="#7FE8FF" /></Path.Stroke>
          <Path.Effect><BlurEffect Radius="26" /></Path.Effect>
        </Path>
        <Path Data="M335,505 C 420,505 420,360 520,360 S 600,360 600,360" StrokeThickness="26" StrokeStartLineCap="Round" StrokeEndLineCap="Round">
          <Path.Stroke><LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,1" EndPoint="1,0"><GradientStop Color="#FF5EE3FF" Offset="0" /><GradientStop Color="#FFFFFFFF" Offset="1" /></LinearGradientBrush></Path.Stroke>
        </Path>
        <Ellipse Canvas.Left="309" Canvas.Top="479" Width="52" Height="52" Fill="#FF5EE3FF" Stroke="#FFFFFFFF" StrokeThickness="8" />
        <Ellipse Canvas.Left="572" Canvas.Top="332" Width="56" Height="56" Fill="#FFFFFFFF" />
        <!-- 支架与底座 -->
        <Path Data="M432,582 L502,582 L516,640 L418,640 Z"><Path.Fill><LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="0,1"><GradientStop Color="#FFC9D6FF" Offset="0" /><GradientStop Color="#FFF2F6FF" Offset="1" /></LinearGradientBrush></Path.Fill></Path>
        <Border Canvas.Left="362" Canvas.Top="632" Width="210" Height="30" CornerRadius="15">
          <Border.Background><LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="0,1"><GradientStop Color="#FFFFFFFF" Offset="0" /><GradientStop Color="#FFD3DEFF" Offset="1" /></LinearGradientBrush></Border.Background>
        </Border>
      </Canvas>
    </Grid>
  </Border>
  <Border Width="824" Height="824" CornerRadius="186" BorderThickness="3">
    <Border.BorderBrush>
      <LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="0,1"><GradientStop Color="#80FFFFFF" Offset="0" /><GradientStop Color="#10FFFFFF" Offset="0.5" /><GradientStop Color="#30FFFFFF" Offset="1" /></LinearGradientBrush>
    </Border.BorderBrush>
  </Border>
</Grid>